{"5155890": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "BID: Blood Is Due", "steam_appid": 5155890, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" > THEY CAME FOR THE MONEY</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Four desperate people arrive at <strong>Facility 07</strong> for the same reason: <strong>They need money.</strong><br><br>A Carmine Life Systems advertisement led them here but what it asks in return was never written on the poster.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5155890/extras/68933f2414782d4df8435f5bb6fc0599.avif?t=1788199248\" width=480 height=178 /></span></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >FOUR GAMES OF CHANCE. FOUR DEALERS.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each dealer has their own game, their own rules, and their own way of turning the odds against you.<br>Learn the game. Learn who is sitting across from you. Then turn the odds back in your favor.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dr. Birdie</strong> plays a twisted take on <strong>Blackjack/21</strong>. Get as close to <strong>11</strong> as possible. Go over, and it's over.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Ms. Marigold</strong> plays a ruthless auction game, where every raise can put either your money or your blood at risk.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Girl B</strong> plays a twisted take on <strong>Chinchirorin</strong>, a three-dice Japanese gambling game where certain combinations can decide everything instantly.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Vespera</strong> plays a deadly variation of <strong>Hi-Lo</strong>, forcing you to judge whether the next result will be higher or lower.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5155890/extras/ec3b56a42036a052163b9bd4d76c02de.avif?t=1788199248\" width=1395 height=670 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >USE CARDS TO EVEN THE ODDS</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cards can turn a losing situation in your favor. But don't rely on them. Their <strong>Blood Cost</strong> rises with every use, turning every advantage into another risk.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5155890/extras/2635b481f890da1b427d34c7f7280d80.poster.avif?t=1788199248\" width=740 height=632 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5155890/extras/2635b481f890da1b427d34c7f7280d80.webm?t=1788199248\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5155890/extras/2635b481f890da1b427d34c7f7280d80.mp4?t=1788199248\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >CHOOSE WHAT YOU NEED BEFORE YOU BLEED FOR IT</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every stop can change the rest of your run.<br>Buy new cards at the <strong>Shop</strong>. Take a <strong>Card Reward</strong>. Recover at <strong>Blood ATMs</strong>. Or seek out more dangerous encounters for bigger rewards.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The safer path keeps you alive.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The dangerous one makes you bleed for more.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5155890/extras/2e3592e71cc21902e6709603cd59d6d9.poster.avif?t=1788199248\" width=780 height=534 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5155890/extras/2e3592e71cc21902e6709603cd59d6d9.webm?t=1788199248\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5155890/extras/2e3592e71cc21902e6709603cd59d6d9.mp4?t=1788199248\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >COLLECT UNIQUE DICE</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Complete achievements to earn <strong>BID Coins</strong>, then spend them at the <strong>Dice Dresser</strong> for a chance to unlock new dice.<br>Collect <strong>16 unique dice skins</strong>, each carrying its own passive effect.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5155890/extras/a316d6dd686fe22c109ae0671a51b05e.poster.avif?t=1788199248\" width=720 height=480 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5155890/extras/a316d6dd686fe22c109ae0671a51b05e.webm?t=1788199248\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5155890/extras/a316d6dd686fe22c109ae0671a51b05e.mp4?t=1788199248\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >FOUR PEOPLE. MORE THAN ONE WAY OUT.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play as <strong>Daniel, Hana, Amara, or Elias</strong>, with different endings waiting for each of them.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Getting the money does not mean getting what they came for.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5155890/extras/75ce0962c38d166fd87a37b40d8e46e0.poster.avif?t=1788199248\" width=780 height=766 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5155890/extras/75ce0962c38d166fd87a37b40d8e46e0.webm?t=1788199248\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5155890/extras/75ce0962c38d166fd87a37b40d8e46e0.mp4?t=1788199248\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >CARMINE LIFE SYSTEMS WANTS SOMETHING</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The games are only what Facility 07 allows you to see <strong>at first</strong>. Look around. Read what was left behind. Return to places that feel different. Pay attention to things that should not be there.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>What does Carmine Life Systems need four desperate people for?</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5155890/extras/d2603cecff5d6f58215e51b65fb0456e.avif?t=1788199248\" width=780 height=439 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p>", "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" > THEY CAME FOR THE MONEY</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Four desperate people arrive at <strong>Facility 07</strong> for the same reason: <strong>They need money.</strong><br><br>A Carmine Life Systems advertisement led them here but what it asks in return was never written on the poster.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5155890/extras/68933f2414782d4df8435f5bb6fc0599.avif?t=1788199248\" width=480 height=178 /></span></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >FOUR GAMES OF CHANCE. FOUR DEALERS.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each dealer has their own game, their own rules, and their own way of turning the odds against you.<br>Learn the game. Learn who is sitting across from you. Then turn the odds back in your favor.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dr. Birdie</strong> plays a twisted take on <strong>Blackjack/21</strong>. Get as close to <strong>11</strong> as possible. Go over, and it's over.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Ms. Marigold</strong> plays a ruthless auction game, where every raise can put either your money or your blood at risk.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Girl B</strong> plays a twisted take on <strong>Chinchirorin</strong>, a three-dice Japanese gambling game where certain combinations can decide everything instantly.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Vespera</strong> plays a deadly variation of <strong>Hi-Lo</strong>, forcing you to judge whether the next result will be higher or lower.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5155890/extras/ec3b56a42036a052163b9bd4d76c02de.avif?t=1788199248\" width=1395 height=670 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >USE CARDS TO EVEN THE ODDS</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cards can turn a losing situation in your favor. But don't rely on them. Their <strong>Blood Cost</strong> rises with every use, turning every advantage into another risk.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5155890/extras/2635b481f890da1b427d34c7f7280d80.poster.avif?t=1788199248\" width=740 height=632 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5155890/extras/2635b481f890da1b427d34c7f7280d80.webm?t=1788199248\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5155890/extras/2635b481f890da1b427d34c7f7280d80.mp4?t=1788199248\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >CHOOSE WHAT YOU NEED BEFORE YOU BLEED FOR IT</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every stop can change the rest of your run.<br>Buy new cards at the <strong>Shop</strong>. Take a <strong>Card Reward</strong>. Recover at <strong>Blood ATMs</strong>. Or seek out more dangerous encounters for bigger rewards.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The safer path keeps you alive.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The dangerous one makes you bleed for more.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5155890/extras/2e3592e71cc21902e6709603cd59d6d9.poster.avif?t=1788199248\" width=780 height=534 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5155890/extras/2e3592e71cc21902e6709603cd59d6d9.webm?t=1788199248\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5155890/extras/2e3592e71cc21902e6709603cd59d6d9.mp4?t=1788199248\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >COLLECT UNIQUE DICE</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Complete achievements to earn <strong>BID Coins</strong>, then spend them at the <strong>Dice Dresser</strong> for a chance to unlock new dice.<br>Collect <strong>16 unique dice skins</strong>, each carrying its own passive effect.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5155890/extras/a316d6dd686fe22c109ae0671a51b05e.poster.avif?t=1788199248\" width=720 height=480 ><source src=\