/></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p>", "short_description": "BID: Blood Is Due is a psychological horror roguelite where you face four deadly games of chance. Roll the dice, build your deck, manage Blood, exploit Dealer passives, choose your route, and risk more for greater rewards.", "supported_languages": "English", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5155890/00ea0704f1c26b0fc28855d34e209423116dec20/header.jpg?t=1788199248", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5155890/76f3640cb2fb6b4a620b7896b7b3e5541f12ed2b/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1788199248", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5155890/76f3640cb2fb6b4a620b7896b7b3e5541f12ed2b/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1788199248", "website": null, "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10 64-bit<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i5-8400 / AMD Ryzen 5 2600<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 4 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> NVIDIA GeForce GTX 1060 6 GB / AMD Radeon RX 580 8 GB<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 9.0<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 2 GB available space</li></ul>", "recommended": "<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10/11 64-bit<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i5-10400 / AMD Ryzen 5 3600<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> NVIDIA GeForce RTX 2060 6 GB / AMD Radeon RX 6600 8 GB<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 11<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 2 GB available space<br></li><li><strong>Additional Notes:</strong> SSD for faster loading times</li></ul>"}, "mac_requirements":